    "chunk_text": "Unfortunately, somewhere along the six-day march,\u00a0 opportunistic politicians joined in the march as it neared Colombo and manipulated a change in the demand from \u201cJustice for the Robe\u201d to \u201cFreedom for Gnanasara Thera\u201d \u2013- a person convicted of Contempt of Court, threatening the wife of a man forcibly disappeared in addition to rabble rousing and preaching race hatred among many other charges.\n\nProtestors made their last stand at the park, but were forced to disperse by the wisdom of the Mahanayaka Theras.\n\nOur country has barely come out of a near three-decade-long ethnic conflict which nearly took the country back to the Stone Age. We should not permit corrupt,\u00a0 defeated politicians\u00a0 to whip up religious hatred as a means to regain political power. Government needs to crack down on\u00a0 ethno-religious hatred."
