    "chunk_text": "Chirath Devasurendra, Managing Director, Cyril Rodrigo\u2019s Restaurants (Pvt) Ltd stated, \u201cFor generations, Green Cabin has been part of the moments which matter most to Sri Lankan families. As the fifth generation of our family to carry it forward, we are growing into banquets and corporate catering and refreshing menus and service for today\u2019s customers, but our commitment remains the same. We provide authenticity, quality and flavours people have always trusted from us. Green Cabin is evolving, but we are not moving away from what made us special.\u201d\n\nCombining two heritage brands together, Green Cabin has also joined hands with Elephant House, to offer Elephant House ice cream and hot dogs at selected Green Cabin outlets, supported by joint promotions. The collaboration unites two of Sri Lanka\u2019s longest-standing food brands, sharing strong consumer familiarity and commitment to quality, offering customers familiar favourites and greater choice for dine-in and takeaway, with opportunities for a wider rollout based on customer response.\n\nGreen Cabin also manages the banquet facilities at Havelock City, the mixed-use development of Overseas Realty (Ceylon) PLC, as \u2018Havelock City Banquets by Green Cabin\u2019."
