    "chunk_text": "Lightning strike damages 11 vehicles at Hambantota Port\n\nColombo, Nov. 1 (Dailly Mirror) - At least 11 imported motor vehicles were damaged after a lightning strike hit a vehicle storage yard at the Hambantota Port premises.\n\nThe incident occurred amid heavy rainfall in the Hambantota area, triggering a fire in the yard where imported vehicles were parked.\n\nThe port's firefighting unit responded promptly and managed to extinguish the blaze.\n\nHambantota Port Police have launched an investigation into the incident."
