    "chunk_text": "Through a carefully curated selection of powerful speakers, change makers and transformative experiences, TEDxColombo 2026 aims to challenge assumptions, as always, spark dialogue and take it a step further into reality, reminding us that even in contrast, there can be connection.\n\nThe event promises an immersive day filled with live talks from a diverse group of speakers, carefully selected TED Talk screenings and vibrant social spaces that encourage meaningful connections among the attendees. With an in-person audience of over 1,000 expected and thousands more engaging online, TEDxColombo continues to be a gathering point for curious minds, bold thinkers and passionate changemakers.\n\nJohn Keells IT returns as the Main Partner of TEDxColombo 2026, marking 10 years of partnership with TEDxColombo since the relationship began in 2016. \u201cBold ideas deserve a stage. Meaningful change demands action. At John Keells IT, we believe progress begins when people have the courage to question what is, imagine what could be and turn that possibility into action. TEDxColombo brings that spirit to life, amplifying Sri Lankan voices, connecting fresh perspectives and challenging us to think beyond familiar boundaries. We are proud to renew our support for a platform that inspires people to shape the future. Think bold. Act brave. Inspire change,\u201d said John Keells IT CEO Dr. Ramesh Shanmuganathan.\n\nTo witness the power of unconventional perspectives and unrelenting passions, mark your calendars for the TEDxColombo event. Stay tuned for more updates on speakers, performances and the exciting lineup that awaits. For further information and registration, visit the official website at www.tedxcolombo.org. Be a part of this transformative experience that will leave an indelible mark on Sri Lanka\u2019s intellectual landscape."
