    "description": "Sunshine Holdings records strong growth in 1HFY27 with revenue up 24.4% and PAT rising 44.3%",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sunshine-Holdings-records-strong-growth-in-1HFY27-with-revenue-up-24-4-and-PAT-rising-44-3/34-799504",
    "lang": "en",
